"00:20.770">it</span><span begin="00:20.770" end="00:20.800">`</span><span begin="00:20.800" end="00:20.890">s </span><span begin="00:20.890" end="00:21.790">makin </span><span begin="00:21.790" end="00:22.480">me </span><span begin="00:22.480" end="00:23.890">insane</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.310" end="00:31.330"><span begin="00:27.310" end="00:27.820">i've </span><span begin="00:27.820" end="00:28.330">been </span><span begin="00:28.330" end="00:29.410">waitin </span><span begin="00:29.410" end="00:29.860">here </span><span begin="00:29.860" end="00:30.430">so </span><span begin="00:30.430" end="00:31.330">long</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.510" end="00:35.740"><span begin="00:31.510" end="00:31.780">but </span><span begin="00:31.780" end="00:32.110">now </span><span begin="00:32.110" end="00:32.500">the </span><span begin="00:32.500" end="00:33.670">moment </span><span begin="00:33.670" end="00:34.270">seems </span><span begin="00:34.270" end="00:34.750">to've </span><span begin="00:34.750" end="00:35.740">come</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.830" end="00:41.080"><span begin="00:35.830" end="00:36.070">I </span><span begin="00:36.070" end="00:36.430">see </span><span begin="00:36.430" end="00:36.850">the </span><span begin="00:36.850" end="00:37.420">dark </span><span begin="00:37.420" end="00:37.960">clouds </span><span begin="00:37.960" end="00:39.160">comin </span><span begin="00:39.160" end="00:39.670">up </span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:41.080">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.890" end="00:44.260"><span begin="00:41.890" end="00:42.490">running </span><span begin="00:42.490" end="00:42.790">through </span><span begin="00:42.790" end="00:43.060">the </span><span begin="00:43.060" end="00:44.260">monsoon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.410" end="00:46.300"><span begin="00:44.410" end="00:45.250">beyond </span><span begin="00:45.250" end="00:45.490">the </span><span begin="00:45.490" end="00:46.300">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.300" end="00:48.430"><span begin="00:46.300" end="00:46.570">to </span><span begin="00:46.570" end="00:46.930">the </span><span begin="00:46.930" end="00:47.410">end </span><span begin="00:47.410" end="00:47.650">of </span><span begin="00:47.650" end="00:48.430">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.430" end="00:50.980"><span begin="00:48.430" end="00:48.730">where </span><span begin="00:48.730" end="00:48.910">the </span><span begin="00:48.910" end="00:49.540">rain </span><span begin="00:49.540" end="00:49.900">won't </span><span begin="00:49.900" end="00:50.980">hurt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.010" end="00:53.080"><span begin="00:51.010" end="00:51.670">fighting </span><span begin="00:51.670" end="00:51.820">the </span><span begin="00:51.820" end="00:53.080">storm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.200" end="00:54.910"><span begin="00:53.200" end="00:53.800">into </span><span begin="00:53.800" end="00:54.010">the </span><span begin="00:54.010" end="00:54.910">blue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.120" end="00:57.070"><span begin="00:55.120" end="00:55.390">and </span><span begin="00:55.390" end="00:55.780">when </span><span begin="00:55.780" end="00:55.900">i </span><span begin="00:55.900" end="00:56.200">lose </span><span begin="00:56.200" end="00:57.070">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.070" end="00:59.290"><span begin="00:57.070" end="00:57.220">i'll </span><span begin="00:57.220" end="00:57.910">think </span><span begin="00:57.910" end="00:58.330">of </span><span begin="00:58.330" end="00:59.290">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.320" end="01:03.850"><span begin="00:59.320" end="01:00.190">together </span><span begin="01:00.190" end="01:00.520">we'll </span><span begin="01:00.520" end="01:00.760">be </span><span begin="01:00.760" end="01:01.480">running </span><span begin="01:01.480" end="01:02.590">somewhere </span><span begin="01:02.590" end="01:03.850">new</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.880" end="01:08.110"><span begin="01:03.880" end="01:04.210">through </span><span begin="01:04.210" end="01:04.450">the </span><span begin="01:04.450" end="01:08.110">monsoon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.140" end="01:13.150"><span begin="01:08.140" end="01:08.560">just </span><span begin="01:08.560" end="01:08.890">me </span><span begin="01:08.890" end="01:09.100">and </span><span begin="01:09.100" end="01:13.150">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.140" end="01:18.580"><span begin="01:14.140" end="01:14.410">a </span><span begin="01:14.410" end="01:14.950">half </span><span begin="01:14.950" end="01:15.460">moon's </span><span begin="01:15.460" end="01:16.540">fading </span><span begin="01:16.540" end="01:17.080">from </span><span begin="01:17.080" end="01:17.530">my </span><span begin="01:17.530" end="01:18.580">sight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.670" end="01:22.900"><span begin="01:18.670" end="01:18.910">I </span><span begin="01:18.910" end="01:19.240">see </span><span begin="01:19.240" end="01:19.690">your </span><span begin="01:19.690" end="01:20.950">vision </span><span begin="01:20.950" end="01:21.490">in </span><span begin="01:21.490" end="01:21.940">it's </span><span begin="01:21.940" end="01:22.900">light</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.960" end="01:28.390"><span begin="01:22.960" end="01:23.260">but </span><span begin="01:23.260" end="01:23.650">now </span><span begin="01:23.650" end="01:24.070">it's </span><span begin="01:24.070" end="01:24.940">gone </span><span begin="01:24.940" end="01:25.030">and </span><span begin="01:25.030" end="01:25.690">left </span><span begin="01:25.690" end="01:26.110">me </span><span begin="01:26.110" end="01:26.830">so </span><span begin="01:26.830" end="01:28.390">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.240" end="01:35.740"><span begin="01:31.240" end="01:31.570">I </span><span begin="01:31.570" end="01:32.140">know </span><span begin="01:32.140" end="01:32.470">I </span><span begin="01:32.470" end="01:33.430">have </span><span begin="01:33.430" end="01:33.610">to </span><span begin="01:33.610" end="01:34.270">find </span><span begin="01:34.270" end="01:34.720">you </span><span begin="01:34.720" end="01:35.740">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.770" end="01:37.810"><span begin="01:35.770" end="01:36.190">can </span><span begin="01:36.190" end="01:36.370">hear </span><span begin="01:36.370" end="01:36.820">your </span><span begin="01:36.820" end="01:37.810">name</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.810" end="01:40.030"><span begin="01:37.810" end="01:37.960">i </span><span begin="01:37.960" end="01:38.500">don't </span><span begin="01:38.500" end="01:38.980">know </span><span begin="01:38.980" end="01:40.030">how</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.060" end="01:45.880"><span begin="01:40.060" end="01:40.360">why </span><span begin="01:40.360" end="01:40.750">can't </span><span begin="01:40.750" end="01:41.110">we </span><span begin="01:41.110" end="01:42.040">make </span><span begin="01:42.040" end="01:42.310">this </span><span begin="01:42.310" end="01:43.390">darkness </span><span begin="01:43.390" end="01:43.870">feel </span><span begin="01:43.870" end="01:44.200">like </span><span begin="01:44.200" end="01:45.880">home</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.150" end="01:48.550"><span begin="01:46.150" end="01:46.780">running </span><span begin="01:46.780" end="01:47.080">through </span><span begin="01:47.080" end="01:47.350">the </span><span begin="01:47.350" end="01:48.550">monsoon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.700" end="01:50.560"><span begin="01:48.700" end="01:49.510">beyond </span><span begin="01:49.510" end="01:49.750">the </span><span begin="01:49.750" end="01:50.560">world</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.560" end="01:52.750"><span begin="01:50.560" end="01:50.860">to </span><span begin="01:50.860" end="01:51.220">the </span><span begin="01:51.220" end="01:51.700">end </span><span begin="01:51.700" end="01:51.940">of </span><span begin="01:51.940" end="01:52.750">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.750" end="01:55.180"><span begin="01:52.750" end="01:53.020">where </span><span begin="01:53.020" end="01:53.200">the </span><span begin="01:53.200" end="01:53.830">rain </span><span begin="01:53.830" end="01:54.160">won't </span><span begin="01:54.160" end="01:55.180">hurt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.300" end="01:57.370"><span begin="01:55.300" end="01:55.960">fighting </span><span begin="01:55.960" end="01:56.110">the </span><span begin="01:56.110" end="01:57.370">storm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.490" end="01:59.230"><span begin="01:57.490" end="01:58.090">into </span><span begin="01:58.090" end="01:58.300">the </span><span begin="01:58.300" end="01:59.230">blue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.410" end="02:01.360"><span begin="01:59.410" end="01:59.680">and </span><span begin="01:59.680" end="02:00.070">when </span><span begin="02:00.070" end="02:00.190">i </span><span begin="02:00.190" end="02:00.490">lose </span><span begin="02:00.490" end="02:01.360">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.360" end="02:03.580"><span begin="02:01.360" end="02:01.510">i'll </span><span begin="02:01.510" end="02:02.200">think </span><span begin="02:02.200" end="02:02.620">of </span><span begin="02:02.620" end="02:03.580">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.610" end="02:07.720"><span begin="02:03.610" end="02:04.480">together </span><span begin="02:04.480" end="02:04.810">we'll </span><span begin="02:04.810" end="02:05.050">be </span><span begin="02:05.050" end="02:05.770">running </span><span begin="02:05.770" end="02:06.850">somewhere </span><span begin="02:06.850" end="02:07.720">new</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.960" end="02:12.250"><span begin="02:07.960" end="02:08.290">and </span><span begin="02:08.290" end="02:08.740">nothing </span><spa